                                                "sense_id": "2a130910-3772-3899-ab37-f06cbb84fc4b",
                                                "text": "To appear in the know, regale your new Italian chums with tales of how he covered the Italy squad in his Panini stickers album with nothing but his own face, or the classic story of the time he was stopped by police with £5,000 in cash in his backpocket and explained it with the line \"Because I am rich\"."
